    "description": "Whenever you begin your turn adjacent to the target of your <b>Ward</b> Talent, you gain <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> equal to your Character Level until the start of your next turn. Damage is subtracted from the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> first, and any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> remaining at the end of the encounter go away. <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> from different sources do not stack.",
